Special Cards
These are special cards that don't fit in any of the other categories.
Author
Forgotten Werewolf
The Author and Forgotten Werewolf have no set abilities. The Host and players may agree on specific rules for them before the game starts. An alternate version of each, called Creator and Lost Werewolf exist. When using both variants, different rules may be used for each.
Host
The Host card is for the player in charge of running the game.
